; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 33. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'btDC_plane_jumping'
btDC_plane_jumping.dialogstring_0981F4! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: We're almost there,[N]Will.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]When you find your dad,[N]give him my regards.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Thanks, Neil. You've[N]come a long way too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I guess we won't[N]see you for a while. When[N]you're done, come straight[N]back to South Cape, okay?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: I will. Traveling[N]with all of you has been[N]the best part of this[N]journey.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Everybody's[N]different now, huh?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lance found his dad, and[N]he and Lilly finally[N]stopped acting weird[N]around each other.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Neil figured out what to[N]do with his family's[N]company.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]And Kara finally got to[N]see the world outside the[N]castle.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Me? I can finally go pee[N]by myself at night![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hahaha.[N]That's our Erik.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: You were already[N]brave, Erik. You went[N]after the slave traders[N]to help Sam.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Yeah, but someone[N]else needed me then. I[N]guess now I can be brave[N]for myself too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Kara, you've been[N]quiet.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]You and Will may not see[N]each other for a while.[N]Don't you have anything[N]to say?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara:[DLY:4] I suppose I do…[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:1]Neil: Well, look ahead.[N]There's the Tower of[N]Babel.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6][DLY:1]Alright, Will. Parachute[N]ready?[N]Let's go![END]`
btDC_plane_jumping.dialogstring_0984B1! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:2]A year and a half after[N]the expedition, Will[N]returns to the Tower of[N]Babel.[PAU:94][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'btDE_monologue'
btDE_monologue.dialogstring_099914! `[DEF]The Tower of Babel stands[N]silent, as if the past[N]year and a half never[N]passed at all[AD][END]`
btDE_monologue.dialogstring_099952! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Is this where Dad and I[N]got separated?)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_crystal_ring'
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099A70! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Something just broke[N]loose from my flute…)[END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099A91! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](T-this is the Crystal[N]Ring King Edward wanted!)[WAI][N](All this time, I thought[N]it was only part of the[N]flute's decoration…)[END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099AE4! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][DLY:9]Will finds the Crystal Ring![PAU:78][END]`
btDF_crystal_ring.dialogstring_099AFE! `[CLR][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]But your inventory[N]is full![PAL:0][END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039F35! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]This is definitely the[N]Crystal Ring that King[N]Edward was searching for.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_kara'
btDF_kara.dialogstring_099F1B! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Wait…[END]`
btDF_kara.dialogstring_099F2A! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Kara!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm sorry…[WAI][N]When we were separated, I[N]had this awful feeling we[N]wouldn't meet again.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: But how did you get[N]in here?[WAI][N]I couldn't enter without[N]this Crystal Ring…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Maybe this ring let[N]me through.[WAI][N]Remember the one I took[N]from the Gold Ship?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](My Crystal Ring is dark[N]blue…)[WAI][N](The ring Kara carries is[N]light blue.)[WAI][N](Light and darkness…[N]Could that be what these[N]rings represent?)[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Whatever happens,[N]stay close to me.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDF_spirits'
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099B8F! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet's light[N]holds great power over the[N]growth of living things.[WAI][N]As the star draws near,[N]that influence grows ever[N]stronger.[WAI][N]Change that would require[N]ages may then occur in a[N]single lifetime.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099C95! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Life hath changed[N]through countless ages.[WAI][N]Creatures of the sea gave[N]way to new forms upon the[N]land, and in time humanity[N]arose.[WAI][N]Change itself is natural.[N]The comet did not create[N]that truth.[WAI][N]It hasteneth change, and[N]would direct its course.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099D16! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Thou hast heard the[N]comet called both blessing[N]and curse.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Both names contain truth.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Its power can free life[N]from sickness, age, and[N]mortal flesh.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]But a gift imposed is no[N]gift at all.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Thy task is not to halt[N]change, Will.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]It is to ensure that[N]life's path remains its[N]own to choose.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099C1E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Time runneth swiftly[N]within the Tower of Babel.[WAI][N]Years may pass here while[N]the world beyond knoweth[N]only moments.[WAI][N]Yet thou and Kara endure.[N]Both of you bear powers[N]older than this tower.[END]`
btDF_spirits.dialogstring_099DE5! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Beings reshaped by[N]the comet's light sleep[N]within the next chamber.[WAI][N]They bar the path above.[N]If thou wouldst ascend,[N]lay them to rest.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btDE_kara_missing'
btDE_kara_missing.dialogstring_0986E1! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Oh, Kara isn't here[AD][N]Where did she go[AD]?)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE2_brought_back'
btE2_brought_back.dialogstring_099866! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Thou hast returned[N]to the place where thy[N]path first crossed the[N]comet's.[WAI][N]I shall bear thee to the[N]floor above.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE1_comet_soon'
btE1_comet_soon.dialogstring_09974E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet draweth[N]near to Earth.[WAI][N]There is little time left.[N]Ascend now to the peak of[N]the Tower of Babel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE3_kara'
btE3_kara.dialogstring_098577! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Kara[AD]![N]Where did you go!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: The vampire woman[N]found me. She only wanted[N]to talk. She can't die[N]while the comet endures.[WAI][N]She thought living forever[N]was a gift. Now she can't[N]escape it.[WAI][N]She believes she can rest[N]at last if the comet's[N]hold is broken.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE3_dao_travel_spirit'
btE3_dao_travel_spirit.dialogstring_098053! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: If thou advancest[N]beyond this point, thou[N]canst not return.[FIN]I can bear thee back to[N]Dao if thou desirest.[FIN]What wilt thou do?[WAI][N][PAL:0] Continue[N] Return to Dao`
btE3_dao_travel_spirit.dialogstring_0980C1! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E853! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: The comet draweth[N]near. Our final parting is[N]at hand.[WAI][N]Thou hast awakened the[N]Darkness carried through[N]thy bloodline.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Yet thou art no mere heir[N]to the Dark Knights.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The comet's light also[N]dwelleth within thee, from[N]the day thou first entered[N]this tower.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Kara descendeth from those[N]once called the Protectors[N]of Light.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Yet my voice hath reached[N]her in dreams.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The old lines have[N]crossed. Neither of you[N]stands where your[N]ancestors stood.[WAI][N]If the heirs of Darkness[N]and Light choose to stand[N]together, the Firebird[N]may awaken.[WAI][N]Fight not because I[N]command thee, nor because[N]thy ancestors once chose[N]Darkness.[WAI][N]Fight so that life may[N]yet possess a future no[N]ancient power hath already[N]chosen.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The choice is thine.[FIN]`
